    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1325">

                <pb facs="1048" n="932" xml:id="pg932"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/745.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent
                    Silliman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 5, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department has following telegram from mine owners in Monterey section:</p>
                <p>[Quotes from Mr. Hanna’s August 4, 1 p.m.]</p>
                <p>Exert best efforts to obtain immediate sending to tax collector at Monterey of
                    instructions along desired lines. Department understood from information
                    heretofore received from you that this had already been done.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
